{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq7hefd9gvi","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] Hold-merge mode: autonomous loop builds in isolation and NEVER merges","summary":"Under the heartbeat loop, every code task runs in an isolated orch/attempt/<slug> worktree, commits there, and completes as 'MERGE PENDING' — it never edits the live checkout, never merges to main, and never calls request_guidance mid-run. Merges/conflicts/failures are all queued for human morning review via the verdict. Merging to main is a human decision.","created_by":"onboard-learn","valid_from":"2026-06-10T03:00:40.653Z","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
